                        "username": "SrideviRamesh"
                    },
                    "message": "Not required to use IF and END it works.. I tested the sample code\n\n```\nTest\n    IF  ${a_count} == 128 and ${b_count} == 256\n    ...  Fail  msg=Failed\n\n    IF  ${a_count} == 128 and ${b_count} == 256\n    ...  Pass Execution  msg=Passed\n\n    IF  ${a_count} == 128 and ${b_count} == 256  Pass Execution\n    ...  msg=Passed\n\n    ${count}=  Set Variable If  ${a_count} == 128\n    ...  Hello  Bye\n\n    Log To Console  ${count}\n```"
                },
